   "etymology": "From Proto-Albanian *kan tan, sequence of two pronouns (Proto-Albanian *kan + *tan). Proto-Albanian *kan from Proto-Indo-European *kʷo-, from Proto-Indo-European *kʷ-. The second element Proto-Albanian *tan from Proto-Indo-European *to-. Continuing in accusative form of kush as kë (Gheg Albanian kâ, kân). See (pronoun) Albanian kë and (nominative form) kush (“who”) for more.\nFrom compound Proto-Albanian *kwom-to-, an indefinite pronoun.",
